# Normalise line endings (LF) so .md/.ps1/.json don't churn between the Windows
# test server (core.autocrlf) and Linux/macOS (CI, prod VDI). Without this, pulling
# from Bitbucket/Stash <-> GitHub flips CRLF/LF and marks every file modified,
# which is a prime cause of the "git history breaks on pull" problem.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
